# --- kept locally, outside the published release ---------------------------
# The project began as twelve 3D visualisations of watermark and style metrics.
# That work is exploratory, is superseded by the measured study in this
# repository, and makes no claim the paper relies on, so it is not published.
# It now lives under archive/legacy-exploratory/ together with the twelve GIFs,
# the document they illustrate and their dependency list.
archive/

